  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A photon of wavelength <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\lambda\"></span> scatters off an electron at rest. The scattered photon has wavelength <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\lambda'\"></span>.</p>\n<p>What is the fraction of the incident photon energy that gets transferred to the electron?</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{\\lambda}{\\lambda'}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{\\lambda'}{\\lambda}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{\\lambda'-\\lambda}{\\lambda}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{\\lambda'-\\lambda}{\\lambda'}\"></span></li></ol>"
  },
